  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project LEADER (Law Enforcement Assistance for Digital Evidence Reliabil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project LEADER is an intitiative  to improve digital forensics capability in beneficiary countries in South and Southeast Asia  to support law enforcement responses to crimes involving potential digital evidence, the analysis and investigation of this evidence, as well related prosecutions.</narrative>
  </description>
